# meson's wrap checkouts — upstream sources, fetched by `meson setup` from the
# revisions pinned in subprojects/*.wrap. Never committed: they are 20 MB of
# somebody else's history, and the wrap file is the reproducible statement of
# which commit this prebuild is built from.
/subprojects/libspiel/
/subprojects/libspeechprovider/
/subprojects/packagecache/
/subprojects/.wraplock
